		"Changing your username can have unintended side effects.": "更改用户名可能会带来意想不到的副作用。",
		"Looking to manage account security settings? You can find them in the": "想管理账号安全设置？你可以在",
		"page.": "页面。",
		"Link Patreon account": "关联 Patreon 账户",
		"Connect a Patreon account for": "为",
		"to sponsor maintainers with. Get recognition on GitHub for sponsorships made on Patreon when the sponsored person has linked Patreon and GitHub, too, and has a public GitHub Sponsors profile.": "连接一个 Patreon 账户，用来赞助维护者。当被赞助者也关联了 Patreon 与 GitHub，并且有公开的 GitHub Sponsors 个人资料时，你可以在 GitHub 上获得通过 Patreon 提供的赞助的认可。",
		"Export account data": "导出账户数据",
		"Export all repositories and profile metadata for": "导出",
		"Exports will be available for 7 days.": "导出数据将在 7 天内可用。",
		"Successor settings": "账号继承设置",
		// 实机节点边界：192 字符节点（含用户名纯文本，且以 "Successor," 结尾）+ <span> 尾段 + 整段
		"By clicking \"Add Successor\" below, I acknowledge that I am the owner of the @Oppenheymu account, and am authorizing GitHub to transfer content within that account to my GitHub Successor,": "点击下方的「添加继承者」，即表示我确认自己是 @Oppenheymu 账户的所有者，并授权 GitHub 把该账户内的内容转移给我下方指定的 GitHub 继承者，",
		", in the event of my death. I understand that this appointment of a successor does not override legally binding next-of-kin rules or estate laws of any relevant jurisdiction, and does not create a binding will.": "此项转移将在我去世后生效。我理解，此项继承者的指定不能凌驾于任何相关司法管辖区的、具有法律约束力的近亲规则或遗产法，也不构成具有约束力的遗嘱。",
		"account, and am authorizing GitHub to transfer content within that account to my GitHub Successor, designated below, in the event of my death. I understand that this appointment of a successor does not override legally binding next-of-kin rules or estate laws of any relevant jurisdiction, and does not create a binding will.": "账户的所有者，并授权 GitHub 在我去世后，把该账户内的内容转移给下方指定的 GitHub 继承者。我理解，此项继承者的指定不能凌驾于任何相关司法管辖区的、具有法律约束力的近亲规则或遗产法，也不构成具有约束力的遗嘱。",
		"Learn more about account successors.": "详细了解账号继承者。",
		"Add Successor": "添加继承者",
		"Search by username, full name, or email address": "按用户名、全名或电子邮件地址搜索",
		"You have not designated a successor.": "你尚未指定继承者。",
		"Delete account": "删除账户",
		"Your account is currently an owner in these organizations": "你的账户目前是以下组织的所有者",
		// 实机节点边界：`You must <a>…</a>, <a>…</a>, or <a>…</a> before you can delete your user.`
		"You must remove yourself from these organizations, transfer ownership, or delete these organizations before you can delete your user.": "你必须先从这些组织中移除自己、转移所有权或删除这些组织，然后才能删除你的用户。",
		"You must": "你必须先",
		"remove yourself from these organizations": "从这些组织中移除自己",
		"transfer ownership": "转移所有权",
		"delete these organizations": "删除这些组织",
		"before you can delete your user.": "然后才能删除你的用户。",
		// —— 按钮 ——
		"Connect with Patreon": "关联 Patreon",
		"Start export": "开始导出",
		"Delete your account": "删除你的账户",
		// —— 外观（/settings/appearance）——
		// 本页两个下拉与两个分段控件的「当前值」本身就是独立文本节点
		// （Rails <details><summary> 结构），故主题名与「开 / 关」各成一条。
		// 主题名里的 protanopia / deuteranopia / tritanopia 是色觉障碍的临床名，
		// 中文界面惯用「红色盲和绿色盲」「蓝色盲」（GitHub 官方中文文档用词）
		"Theme preferences": "主题偏好",
		"Choose how GitHub looks to you. Select a single theme, or sync with your system and automatically switch between day and night themes. Selections are applied immediately and saved automatically.": "选择 GitHub 对你的呈现方式。你可以选定单一主题，也可以跟随系统在日间与夜间主题之间自动切换。选择会立即生效并自动保存。",
		"Theme mode": "主题模式",
		"Single theme": "单主题",
		"Sync with system": "跟随系统",
		"GitHub theme will match your system active settings": "GitHub 主题将匹配你系统的当前设置",
		"Light theme": "浅色主题",
		"This theme will be active when your system is set to “light mode”": "当你的系统设为「浅色模式」时，将使用此主题",
		"Dark theme": "深色主题",
		"This theme will be active when your system is set to “dark mode”": "当你的系统设为「深色模式」时，将使用此主题",
		"Selected theme:": "选中的主题：",
		"Light default": "浅色默认",
		"Light protanopia and deuteranopia": "浅色（红色盲和绿色盲）",
		"Light tritanopia": "浅色（蓝色盲）",
		"Dark default": "深色默认",
		"Dark protanopia and deuteranopia": "深色（红色盲和绿色盲）",
		"Dark tritanopia": "深色（蓝色盲）",
		"Soft dark": "柔和深色",
		"Contrast": "对比度",
		"Increase contrast": "提高对比度",
		"Enable high contrast for light or dark mode (or both) based on your system settings": "按你的系统设置，为浅色模式或深色模式（或两者）启用高对比度",
		"Light mode": "浅色模式",
		"Dark mode": "深色模式",
		// 分段控件 / 开关的两态：本页用「开启 / 关闭」比仓库设置页的「开 / 关」更自然
		"Off": "关闭",
		"On": "开启",
		"Preferred default emoji skin tone": "默认表情符号肤色",
		// 选项文本带 emoji 前缀，译文保留 emoji 与原有空格
		"👋 Neutral": "👋 中性",
		"👋🏻 Light Skin Tone": "👋🏻 浅肤色",
		"👋🏼 Medium-Light Skin Tone": "👋🏼 中浅肤色",
		"👋🏽 Medium Skin Tone": "👋🏽 中等肤色",
		"👋🏾 Medium-Dark Skin Tone": "👋🏾 中深肤色",
		"👋🏿 Dark Skin Tone": "👋🏿 深肤色",
		"Tab size preference": "制表符宽度偏好",
		"Choose the number of spaces a tab is equal to when rendering code": "选择渲染代码时一个制表符等于多少个空格",
		"4 (Default)": "4（默认）",
		"Markdown editor font preference": "Markdown 编辑器字体偏好",
		"Font preference for plain text editors that support Markdown styling (e.g. pull request and issue descriptions, comments.)": "支持 Markdown 样式的纯文本编辑器（例如拉取请求与议题的描述、评论）的字体偏好",
		"Use a fixed-width (monospace) font when editing Markdown": "编辑 Markdown 时使用等宽（monospace）字体",
		// —— 辅助功能（/settings/accessibility）——
		// 键必须与 GitHub 实际渲染的文本逐字符一致。本页的长说明句在实机里被拆成多个节点
		// （链接、`<kbd>`、`sr-only` 各自成节点），整句键永远不会命中，必须按节点逐片收录；
		// 片段译文要能直接拼接：前导空格由 walker 从原节点保留，需要与按键隔开时在译文末尾留空格。
		// 按键名与专名一律不译：Ctrl / ⇧ / V / Alt / ↑ / g / n / ? / Markdown / URL / GitHub。
		"Accessibility settings": "辅助功能设置",
		"General": "常规",
		// 「Character keys」指不使用修饰键的单字母快捷键（GitHub 官方文档称 character keys）
		"Keyboard shortcuts": "键盘快捷键",
		"Character keys": "字符快捷键",
		// 实机边界（整句永不出现）：Enable + <a>GitHub shortcuts</a> + that don't use … the
		//   + <kbd>g</kbd> + <kbd>n</kbd> + and + shortcut to navigate notifications, or
		//   + <span class="sr-only">question mark</span> + <kbd aria-hidden="true">?</kbd> + to view …
		// 只按碎片收录：整句键在实机里永不出现，留着反而会与碎片键互相顶替（同一节点命中错的那条）。
		"Enable": "启用",
		"GitHub shortcuts": "GitHub 快捷键",
		// 片段译文以「例如 」收尾（带一个尾随空格），让 <kbd>g</kbd><kbd>n</kbd> 与前句隔开
