		"You can block a user to deny them access to repositories and more.": "你可以屏蔽用户，以禁止其访问你的仓库等。",
		"Learn more about blocking a user": "详细了解如何屏蔽用户",
		"Search by username, full name or email address": "按用户名、全名或电子邮件地址搜索",
		"You are about to block:": "你即将屏蔽：",
		"Blocking a user prevents the following on all your repositories:": "屏蔽用户后，会在你的所有仓库中阻止以下操作：",
		"opening or commenting on issues or pull requests": "打开议题或拉取请求，或对其发表评论",
