		"starring, forking, or watching": "星标、复刻或关注",
		"send you notifications by @mentioning your username in public repositories": "在公开仓库中通过 @ 提及你的用户名向你发送通知",
		"invite you as a collaborator to their repositories": "邀请你作为其仓库的协作者",
		"Additionally, blocked users are not able to:": "此外，被屏蔽的用户无法进行以下操作：",
		"Close all open issues, pull requests, and discussions opened by this user": "关闭此用户打开的所有议题、拉取请求和讨论",
