		"We will show this warning each time you visit a repository where someone you blocked has committed code, unless you own the repository or have also contributed a commit. This warning does not restrict your access.": "当你访问的仓库中有你屏蔽过的用户提交过代码时，我们会显示此警告——除非该仓库归你所有，或你本人也曾提交过。此警告不会限制你的访问。",
