		// —— /settings/interaction_limits（临时交互限制）——
		"Temporary interaction limits": "临时交互限制",
		"Temporarily restrict which external users can interact with your repositories (comment, open issues, or create pull requests) for a configurable period of time.": "在可配置的一段时间内，临时限制哪些外部用户可与你的仓库交互（发表评论、打开议题或创建拉取请求）。",
		"Enable interaction limits for:": "为以下对象启用交互限制：",
		"Limit to existing users": "限制为现有用户",
		"Users that have recently created their account will be unable to interact with your repositories.": "最近创建账户的用户将无法与你的仓库交互。",
		"Limit to prior contributors": "限制为之前的贡献者",
		"Users that have not previously committed to the default branch of one of your repositories will be unable to interact with that repository.": "此前未曾向你任一仓库的默认分支提交过的用户将无法与该仓库交互。",
		"Limit to repository collaborators": "限制为仓库协作者",
