		"Learn more about enterprises": "详细了解企业",
		// —— /settings/repositories（仓库默认设置；证据是整页截图 + 同类组件的既有实测）——
		"Repository default branch": "仓库默认分支",
		// 段落被链接切开：前段译文以句号收尾，链接（含句号）单独成条
		"Choose the default branch for your new personal repositories. You might want to change the default name due to different workflows, or because your integrations still require “master” as the default branch name. You can always change the default branch name on individual repositories.": "为你的新个人仓库选择默认分支。由于不同的工作流，或因为你的集成仍需要将 “master” 作为默认分支名，你可能想更改默认名称。你随时可以在单个仓库上更改默认分支名。",
		"Learn more about default branches.": "详细了解默认分支。",
		"Update": "更新",
