		// —— 访问与安全 ——
		"Access and security": "访问与安全",
		"Codespaces you create for your personal account can either be restricted to accessing the repository it was opened for, or granted read access to other repositories you own.": "你为个人账户创建的代码空间，可以限制为只能访问它为之打开的仓库，也可以授予对你拥有的其他仓库的读取权限。",
		"Limit access of personal Codespaces to the repository they were opened for": "将个人代码空间的访问限制为其打开时所针对的仓库",
		"All Codespaces can access other repositories I own": "所有代码空间都可以访问我拥有的其他仓库",
		"Personal Codespaces created for specific repositories can access other repositories I own": "为特定仓库创建的个人代码空间可以访问我拥有的其他仓库",
		// —— GPG 验证与设置同步 ——
		"GPG verification": "GPG 验证",
		"Codespaces can have GPG commit signing capabilities so that GitHub can verify that commits made in the codespace come from a trusted source. When enabled, this setting will be applied to your list of trusted repositories.": "代码空间可以具备 GPG 提交签名能力，以便 GitHub 验证在代码空间中创建的提交来自可信来源。启用后，此设置将应用于你的受信任仓库列表。",
		"GPG signing will be available in Codespaces": "GPG 签名将在代码空间中可用",
		"GPG signing and VS Code Settings Sync will be available for codespaces for all repositories": "GPG 签名和 VS Code 设置同步将可用于所有仓库的代码空间",
		"GPG signing and VS Code Settings Sync will be available for codespaces from the selected repositories": "GPG 签名和 VS Code 设置同步将可用于所选仓库的代码空间",
		"Settings Sync": "设置同步",
		"By enabling, your codespaces will be able to pull from VS Code Settings Sync service and push only for the trusted repositories you specify. Only enable this for repositories that you trust.": "启用后，你的代码空间将可以从 VS Code 设置同步服务拉取，并且仅对你指定的受信任仓库推送。请只对你信任的仓库启用此设置。",
		"VS Code Settings Sync will be available in Codespaces": "VS Code 设置同步将在代码空间中可用",
		// —— 受信任的仓库（仓库选择器）——
		"Trusted repositories": "受信任的仓库",
		"The following repositories will be referenced by GPG verification and Settings Sync.": "以下仓库将被 GPG 验证与设置同步引用。",
		"GPG and VS Code Settings Sync will be available for Codespaces from these repositories.": "GPG 与 VS Code 设置同步将可用于这些仓库中的代码空间。",
		"Select repository": "选择仓库",
		"Selected repositories": "已选仓库",
		"No matching repositories.": "没有匹配的仓库。",
		// —— 删除提醒 ——
