		"Saved replies are re-usable text snippets that you can use throughout GitHub comment fields. Saved replies can save you time if you’re often typing similar responses.": "保存的回复是可重复使用的文本片段，你可以在 GitHub 的各个评论框中直接使用。如果你经常需要输入类似的回复，保存的回复可以帮你节省时间。",
