		"Read more about connecting with third-party applications at": "详细了解如何连接第三方应用，请访问",
		"You have granted": "你已授予",
		"access to your account.": "访问你账户的权限。",
		"Revoke all": "全部撤销",
		"I understand, revoke access": "我明白，撤销访问权限",
		"I understand, revoke access for everything": "我明白，撤销所有访问权限",
		"Are you sure you want to revoke authorization?": "你确定要撤销授权吗？",
		"Are you sure you want to revoke access for all GitHub Apps?": "你确定要撤销所有 GitHub Apps 的访问权限吗？",
		"Type your username to confirm": "输入你的用户名以确认",
		// 三段拼接：这将撤销 + 所有 + GitHub Apps 的访问权限。此操作无法撤销。
		"all": "所有",
		"GitHub Apps. This action cannot be undone.": "GitHub Apps 的访问权限。此操作无法撤销。",
		// —— /settings/apps（自己开发的 GitHub Apps；证据是实机 HTML）——
		"No GitHub Apps": "没有 GitHub 应用",
		"Want to build something that integrates with and extends GitHub? Register a new GitHub App to get started developing on the GitHub API.": "想构建能与 GitHub 集成并扩展 GitHub 的功能？注册一个新的 GitHub 应用，即可开始基于 GitHub API 进行开发。",
		"New GitHub App": "新建 GitHub 应用",
		// —— /settings/reminders（定时提醒；证据是实机截图）——
